WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.719
Step 1. Open the purchase delivery. You add items while the delivery is Draft.

1.2
00:00:05.719 --> 00:00:09.575
In the store's Purchase Deliveries, in the Created tab,

1.3
00:00:09.575 --> 00:00:32.034
select View Details for the Draft delivery.

2.1
00:00:32.034 --> 00:00:37.099
Step 2. Add an item. Select Add Item.

3.1
00:00:37.099 --> 00:00:41.466
Step 3. Select the product. Pick the Product Knowledge.

3.2
00:00:41.466 --> 00:00:49.352
Care fills the row from its most recent Active batch.

4.1
00:00:49.352 --> 00:00:55.515
Step 4. Select the batch. Under Existing Batches, select the batch that arrived.

4.2
00:00:55.515 --> 00:00:58.897
Its stock at the store shows beside it.

5.1
00:00:58.897 --> 00:01:04.974
Step 5. Enter the quantity. Enter the number of packs. Care calculates the quantity,

5.2
00:01:04.974 --> 00:01:10.053
and fills in the purchase price of one pack for an existing batch.

6.1
00:01:10.053 --> 00:01:13.612
Step 6. Save the item. Select Save Changes.

6.2
00:01:13.612 --> 00:01:18.691
The item shows under Items to Receive with the status In Progress.

6.3
00:01:18.691 --> 00:01:26.007
Nothing goes into stock until you receive it.
